  data: {
    LLM: 'Game: Porrazo. Fishing. 3 cards per deal. Capture by match + sequence. Porrazo/counter/san benito. Ronda/rondine. 61 to win.',
    Player: 'Porrazo: play a card. Match = capture it and sequence. Porrazo when you match the previous (uncaptured) card. Ronda, limpia, cards in place. 61 wins.',
    objective: 'Reach 61 points first. Score via ronda/rondine, porrazo/counter porrazo/san benito, limpia, cards in place, tendido, and card count.',
    gameplay: "1. **Ronda/Rondine**: After each 3-card deal, players with pairs announce 'ronda', with trips 'rondine'. After those 3 played, highest scores (K=4/12, Q=3/9, J=2/6, 2-A=1/3). 2. **Capture**: Play a card. Match = capture matched + ascending sequence (A above K). No match = card stays. 3. **Porrazo**: Previous play captured nothing; you play matching card = porrazo (bonus). Next player can counter porrazo with 3rd matching; 4th = san benito (instant win). 4. **Limpia**: Capture all table cards; score by last card rank. 5. **Cards in place**: A/2/3/4 played without capture so table count = card value; score that many. 6. **Tendido**: Dealer deals 4 face-up once; score A-4 in place, pairs/trips/fours.",
    keyRules: [
      'Sequences turn corner: A above K, 2 above A.',
      'Porrazo only when previous card captured nothing; must match exactly.',
      'Cards in place: only time capture can be forgone.',
      'Last player to capture gets remaining table cards when deck exhausted.',
      '61 points wins.',
    ],
    bonusRuleGuids: [],
    useTrump: false,
    trumpBonusValues: null,
    setup: {
      players: '2-8. Best 2; 4 can play partnership (opposite).',
      deck: 'Standard 52 cards. A (low) to K (high). Suits irrelevant.',
      equipment: '52 cards, cribbage board or paper for score.',
      dealing: '3 cards each, then play. Repeat until deck exhausted. Once per dealer turn: deal tendido (4 face-up) after a 3-card deal.',
    },
    turnFlow: "1. **Ronda/Rondine**: After each 3-card deal, players with pairs announce 'ronda', with trips 'rondine'. After those 3 played, highest scores (K=4/12, Q=3/9, J=2/6, 2-A=1/3). 2. **Capture**: Play a card. Match = capture matched + ascending sequence (A above K). No match = card stays. 3. **Porrazo**: Previous play captured nothing; you play matching card = porrazo (bonus). Next player can counter porrazo with 3rd matching; 4th = san benito (instant win). 4. **Limpia**: Capture all table cards; score by last card rank. 5. **Cards in place**: A/2/3/4 played without capture so table count = card value; score that many. 6. **Tendido**: Dealer deals 4 face-up once; score A-4 in place, pairs/trips/fours.",
